:''XP obtained from battle increased!''
The '''Philosopher's Stone''' is the fourth [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]. Like the [[Neutrino]] with which it stacks, it increases the amount of XP earned from [[Battle]]s. It is significantly more effectual than the Neutrino.

==Effect==
Increases the amount of XP rewarded upon clearing a level by up to 50% per chapter it is active in.

When a player has activated Philosopher's Stone at 100% in all 3 chapters, XP awarded is increased by 150%.

